### ============================================
### ORDER SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/order-items
@orderItemId = 1
@orderId = 1


### Create a new order item
### Request Body: BookingDto
### Response: Created BookingDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "uuid-order",
  "productId": "uuid-product",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": 50.00
}

### Update order item by ID
### Request Body: BookingDto
### Response: Updated BookingDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{orderItemId}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3,
  "price": 75.00
}

### Get order item by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: BookingDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{orderItemId}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all items by order ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<BookingDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/order/{{orderId}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete order by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{{orderItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
